# expect.stdout: hello from external literal\n
# expect.exit: 0
# expect.xfail: feature_coverage.py runs through bootstrap_general.sscript which does not yet inline the bytes of a `literalSource` path into a `literal` const. Direct semsc.py compilation works correctly (`python compiler/semsc.py THIS_FILE --emit-exe /tmp/x.exe && /tmp/x.exe` prints the contents of _modules/external_greeting_literal.txt). Closing means teaching bootstrap_general to read literalSource paths at compile time and embed the bytes as the literal's const value.
project LiteralSourceLoader
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
